en J. Thompunkal","group":"General Medicine","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Biren%20J.%20Thompunkal","keywords":"General Medicine  MBBS, DCH, MD"},{"name":"Dr. Megha Isac","group":"General Medicine","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Megha%20Isac","keywords":"General Medicine  MBBS, MD (General Medicine), DNB (General Medicine)"},{"name":"Dr. Abraham K. Paul","group":"Paediatrics","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Abraham%20K.%20Paul","keywords":"Paediatrics  MBBS, MD (Paed.), DCH, FIAP, FNNF"},{"name":"Dr. S. Sachidananda Kamath","group":"Paediatrics","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20S.%20Sachidananda%20Kamath","keywords":"Paediatrics  MBBS, DCH, MD (Paed.), DHHM, PGDAP"},{"name":"Dr. Antony Clement","group":"Paediatrics","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Antony%20Clement","keywords":"Paediatrics  MBBS, DCH, Fellow in Neonatology"},{"name":"Dr. Mammen Alexander","group":"Orthopaedics","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Mammen%20Alexander","keywords":"Orthopaedics  MBBS, D'Ortho, MS (Ortho)"},{"name":"Dr. M.B. Nitheesh","group":"Orthopaedics","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20M.B.%20Nitheesh","keywords":"Orthopaedics  MBBS, D'Ortho, DNB (Ortho), MNAMS, Fellowship in Joint Reconstruction Surgery"},{"name":"Dr. Nitya Cherukavil","group":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Nitya%20Cherukavil","keywords":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology  MBBS, DGO, DNB (Obst. & Gynaec.)"},{"name":"Dr. Zubaida Sayeed","group":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Zubaida%20Sayeed","keywords":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology  MBBS, MD"},{"name":"Dr. Nithin Kailash","group":"Pulmonology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Nithin%20Kailash","keywords":"Pulmonology  MBBS, MD (Pulmonology)"},{"name":"Prof. Dr. V.I. Paul","group":"Dental & Maxillofacial Surgery","href":"/doctors?q=Prof.%20Dr.%20V.I.%20Paul","keywords":"Dental & Maxillofacial Surgery  BDS, MDS"},{"name":"Dr. Mohammed Sageer A.S.","group":"Dental & Maxillofacial Surgery","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Mohammed%20Sageer%20A.S.","keywords":"Dental & Maxillofacial Surgery  BDS, MDS (Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery)"},{"name":"Dr. Sachin Suresh","group":"ENT","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Sachin%20Suresh","keywords":"ENT  MBBS, MS (ENT)"},{"name":"Dr. Melwin Tom","group":"ENT","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Melwin%20Tom","keywords":"ENT  MBBS, MS (ENT)"},{"name":"Dr. Miriyam Joseph","group":"Psychiatry","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Miriyam%20Joseph","keywords":"Psychiatry  MBBS, MD (Psychiatry)"},{"name":"Dr. Bavij Balan","group":"Psychiatry","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Bavij%20Balan","keywords":"Psychiatry  MBBS, DPM, PGD (Child Psychology), PGD (Counselling Psychology), Fellowship in Family Medicine (AFPI)"},{"name":"Dr. Narayanan Harimohan","group":"Palliative Medicine","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Narayanan%20Harimohan","keywords":"Palliative Medicine  MBBS, DMRT (Dip. in Medical Radiotherapy), CCPPM (Certificate Course in Pain & Palliative Medicine), Fellowship in Palliative Medicine"},{"name":"Dr. Elizabeth K. Paul","group":"Dermatology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Elizabeth%20K.%20Paul","keywords":"Dermatology  MBBS, MD (Venereology & Leprosy)"},{"name":"Dr. Aleyamma Thomas","group":"Ophthalmology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Aleyamma%20Thomas","keywords":"Ophthalmology  MBBS, MS (Ophthalmology)"},{"name":"Dr. Asha Mathew","group":"Microbiology","href":"/doctors?q=Dr.%20Asha%20Mathew","keywords":"Microbiology  MBBS, MD (Microbiology)"},{"name":"Mrs. Maya B. Nair","group":"Clinical Psychology","href":"/doctors?q=Mrs.%20Maya%20B.%20Nair","keywords":"Clinical Psychology  BSc, MSc in Psychiatric Medicine, MSc in Clinical Psychology, MPhil in Clinical Psychology"},{"name":"Mrs. K.P. Sajina","group":"Clinical Psychology","href":"/doctors?q=Mrs.%20K.P.%20Sajina","keywords":"Clinical Psychology  PG Diploma in Guidance & Counselling, MA, MPhil (Counselling & Guidance)"},{"name":"Mr. Anoob Jacob John","group":"Physiotherapy","href":"/doctors?q=Mr.%20Anoob%20Jacob%20John","keywords":"Physiotherapy  Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT)"},{"name":"Mrs. Alphonsa Prabha Soloman","group":"Dietetics","href":"/doctors?q=Mrs.%20Alphonsa%20Prabha%20Soloman","keywords":"Dietetics  MSc (Food & Nutrition)"},{"name":"Mrs. Susan Roby","group":"Dietetics","href":"/doctors?q=Mrs.%20Susan%20Roby","keywords":"Dietetics  BSc, PG Diploma in Dietetics"},{"name":"Cardiology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Cardiology","keywords":" Diagnosis and management of heart conditions, including coronary artery disease, hypertension, heart failure and heart rhythm disorders. The department also provides cardiac services such as pacemaker implantation, where clinically indicated. cardiology"},{"name":"Cardiothoracic & Vascular Surgery","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Cardiothoracic%20%26%20Vascular%20Surgery","keywords":"CTVS Surgical treatment for conditions affecting the heart, chest and major blood vessels. This includes heart surgery, chest (thoracic) surgery, and vascular and endovascular procedures such as stenting and EVAR, a repair of a swollen aorta from inside the blood vessel. cardiothoracic-vascular-surgery"},{"name":"Medical Oncology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Medical%20Oncology","keywords":" Medical treatment for different types of cancer, including chemotherapy and other drug-based therapies. Treatment plans are based on the type and stage of cancer and the individual patient's needs. medical-oncology"},{"name":"Surgical Oncology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Surgical%20Oncology","keywords":" Surgical treatment for cancer, with procedures planned according to the type, location and stage of the disease. Care may be coordinated with medical oncology and other specialists as part of the patient's treatment plan. surgical-oncology"},{"name":"Paediatric Oncology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Paediatric%20Oncology","keywords":" Specialist care for infants, children and adolescents diagnosed with cancer. The department focuses on diagnosis, treatment planning and ongoing care for childhood cancers. paediatric-oncology"},{"name":"Neurology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Neurology","keywords":" Diagnosis and medical treatment of conditions affecting the brain, spinal cord and nerves, including stroke, epilepsy, headaches and migraine, nerve damage (neuropathy) and movement disorders such as Parkinson's disease. The team also provides care for patients with urgent neurological conditions in the emergency department and intensive care unit. neurology"},{"name":"Neurosurgery","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Neurosurgery","keywords":" Surgical treatment for conditions affecting the brain, spine and nervous system, including brain and spinal tumours, head injuries and spinal disorders. neurosurgery"},{"name":"Gastroenterology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Gastroenterology","keywords":" Diagnosis and treatment of problems with the food pipe (oesophagus), stomach, intestines, liver, pancreas and gallbladder, including endoscopy, which uses a thin camera to look inside the digestive tract. gastroenterology"},{"name":"Nephrology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Nephrology","keywords":" Medical care for acute and chronic kidney disease, kidney-related high blood pressure and complications of kidney failure. The department also manages the hospital’s Dialysis Unit, providing regular haemodialysis and dialysis support for critically ill patients in intensive care. nephrology"},{"name":"Urology","group":"Super Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Urology","keywords":" Diagnosis and treatment of conditions affecting the kidneys, bladder and urinary tract, as well as the male reproductive system. These include kidney stones, urinary tract infections and prostate conditions. The department also provides care for urinary problems in women and children, along with reconstructive urological procedures. urology"},{"name":"General Medicine","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=General%20Medicine","keywords":" Diagnosis and treatment of common illnesses, infections, chronic conditions and other adult health concerns. general-medicine"},{"name":"General & Laparoscopic Surgery","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=General%20%26%20Laparoscopic%20Surgery","keywords":" Surgical care for conditions that may require conventional or minimally invasive procedures. general-laparoscopic-surgery"},{"name":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Obstetrics%20%26%20Gynaecology","keywords":" Healthcare for women at different stages of life, including pregnancy, childbirth and gynaecological conditions. obstetrics-gynaecology"},{"name":"Paediatrics","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Paediatrics","keywords":" Medical care for infants, children and adolescents, including the diagnosis and treatment of childhood illnesses. paediatrics"},{"name":"Orthopaedics","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Orthopaedics","keywords":" Treatment and management of conditions affecting bones, joints, muscles and the musculoskeletal system, including injuries and fractures. orthopaedics"},{"name":"Diabetology","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Diabetology","keywords":" Care for people with diabetes, including blood sugar management, monitoring and guidance on preventing complications. diabetology"},{"name":"Pulmonology","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Pulmonology","keywords":" Diagnosis and treatment of conditions affecting the lungs and respiratory system, including asthma and other breathing disorders. pulmonology"},{"name":"ENT","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=ENT","keywords":" Medical and surgical care for conditions affecting the ear, nose and throat. ent"},{"name":"Ophthalmology","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Ophthalmology","keywords":" Eye examinations, vision care and treatment of eye conditions. ophthalmology"},{"name":"Dermatology","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Dermatology","keywords":" Diagnosis and treatment of skin, hair and nail conditions. dermatology"},{"name":"Dental & Maxillofacial Surgery","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Dental%20%26%20Maxillofacial%20Surgery","keywords":" Dental care and treatment of conditions affecting the teeth, mouth, jaw and facial structures. dental-maxillofacial-surgery"},{"name":"Psychiatry","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Psychiatry","keywords":" Assessment and treatment of mental health conditions, with support for emotional and psychological wellbeing. psychiatry"},{"name":"Palliative Medicine","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Palliative%20Medicine","keywords":" Care focused on relieving pain and other symptoms, improving comfort and supporting patients and families living with serious illnesses. palliative-medicine"},{"name":"Ayurveda","group":"Broad Specialities","href":"/doctors?speciality=Ayurveda","keywords":" Traditional Ayurvedic healthcare and treatment based on individual health needs. ayurveda"},{"name":"Emergency Medicine","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Emergency%20Medicine","keywords":" Round-the-clock medical attention for accidents, injuries and sudden illnesses. Our emergency team is available 24 hours a day. emergency-medicine"},{"name":"Anaesthesiology","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Anaesthesiology","keywords":" Anaesthesia and pain management services for patients undergoing surgical and other medical procedures. anaesthesiology"},{"name":"Radiology & Imaging","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Radiology%20%26%20Imaging","keywords":" Diagnostic imaging services, including X-rays, ultrasound and CT scans, to help doctors investigate and assess medical conditions. radiology-imaging"},{"name":"Microbiology","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Microbiology","keywords":" Laboratory testing to identify bacteria, viruses, fungi and other microorganisms that may cause infections. microbiology"},{"name":"EECP","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=EECP","keywords":" Enhanced External Counterpulsation (EECP) is a non-invasive treatment used for selected patients with certain heart conditions. Treatment suitability is assessed by a cardiologist. eecp"},{"name":"Physiotherapy","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Physiotherapy","keywords":" Rehabilitation and physical therapy to help patients improve movement, strength and function after illness, injury or surgery. physiotherapy"},{"name":"Dietetics","group":"Clinical Support","href":"/doctors?speciality=Dietetics","keywords":" Personalised nutritional guidance to support patients with medical conditions, during treatment and throughout recovery. dietetics"}]}],"$L13"]}]]}],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"]}],["$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"],"$L1e"]}],"p":"$@1f","v":"$20","s":"$9"}}]]
